OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 18, dies six days
OL,4,Aafter crash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn 18-year-old motorcyclist has died
OL,7,Fsix days after a crash in Matlock Bath.
OL,9,FDerbyshire Police said the crash at
OL,10,F22:05 BST on 11 August involved a red
OL,11,FAprilia RX 125 motorcycle and a black
OL,12,FAudi A1, at the junction of the A6 and
OL,13,FTemple Road, which leads to the
OL,14,FGulliver's Kingdom theme park.
OL,16,FAlfie Ajai Stocks, who was riding the
OL,17,Fmotorcycle, was taken to hospital and
OL,18,Fdied on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
