OL,3,GNEWSAMotorcyclist, 18, dies six days
OL,4,Aafter crash with car
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice added the driver of the Audi - a
OL,7,F21-year-old woman from Chesterfield -
OL,8,Fattended a voluntary interview on 12
OL,9,FAugust, when she was interviewed under
OL,10,Fcaution on suspicion of causing serious
OL,11,Finjury by dangerous driving. The force
OL,12,Fconfirmed she had been released under
OL,13,Finvestigation while inquiries
OL,14,Fcontinued.
